{"id":"vod_md_5802","vodId":"5802","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"天降之物","name_cn":"天降之物","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231008-1/9d95c696a1f722f4a6089a7995d4f3a8.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在和平宁静的空美町，平凡的少年樱井智树（保志总一朗 配音）过着独居的生活。每晚，智树都会梦见有天使从天而降，虽然被梦境所困扰，但智树的每一天依然能称得上是风平浪静。某一日，名叫伊卡洛斯（早见沙织 配音）的不明生物降落到了智树的身边，有着一张可爱面孔的她，后背上却长着硕大的羽翼。难道梦境中的一切变为现实了？善良的智树收留了伊卡洛斯，他的温柔和陈恳打动了这位本该无情的天使。之后，妮姆芙（野水伊织 配音）和阿斯特蕾亚（福原香织 配音）两位天使也被智树感化留在了他的身边。这些天使们从何而来？为何而来？在她们的背后，似乎隐藏了许多不为人知的秘密。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-08 08:21:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/srN8UyRz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/yw2foPZq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/tVVP0KOH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/Wmyflod8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/pz04kZXc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/KqeNHEyo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/X6jOsT7I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/3ajLYWbT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/14ipVcIG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/EeU9K4M5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/eCQin7oV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/FaA3AYbv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/iugX7sWk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231007/dcXvjxMx/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.581Z"}